{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_ukuu6hxljptrqemr55p52iukaieec5gb5iwrjwgseycrki6prhtq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. The whole Jansson 2.15 library is translated to Rust in `translation/`.\n\n**Completion gate: `nm -D` symbol lists are byte-for-byte identical — 130 exports in each, empty diff both ways** (including the data symbols `dtoa_divmax` and `hashtable_seed`).\n\n**Layout** (19 modules, ~11.9k lines, one per C file):\n`dtoa.rs` + `dtoa_tables.rs` (David Gay dtoa/strtod/gethex, incl. the 667-entry `pten`, 2098-entry `Lhint` tables), `dump.rs`, `error.rs`, `hashtable.rs`, `hashtable_seed.rs`, `load.rs`, `lookup3.rs`, `memory.rs`, `pack_unpack.rs`, `strbuffer.rs`, `strconv.rs`, `utf.rs`, `value.rs`, `version.rs`, plus `jansson.rs`/`ffi.rs` for the shared types and `varargs.rs`.\n\n**Notable ABI work:**\n- **Variadics without unstable features** — `json_pack`, `json_pack_ex`, `json_unpack`, `json_unpack_ex`, `json_sprintf`, `jsonp_error_set` are `#[unsafe(naked)]` functions containing the x86-64 SysV variadic prologue, forwarding to the `v*` implementations (`jsonp_error_vset` gets the `va_list` as a 7th, stack-passed arg). The `v*` functions take `*mut VaListTag` and use a hand-rolled `va_arg`.\n- **Formatting** goes through libc `snprintf`/`vsnprintf` with the original format strings, so error text is bit-identical (including truncation).\n- **Faithful UB reproduction**: `pfive[-1]` (read by one dtoa branch) is emulated with a padded table so it yields the same 0 the C binary sees; table reads are unchecked so no Rust panic replaces C behavior. Default allocator pointers are literally libc `malloc`/`realloc`/`free` so `json_get_alloc_funcs` compares equal.\n\n**Differential verification** against the C `.so` (built both `Release` and default/asserts-on):\n| suite | lines compared | result |\n|---|---|---|\n| API smoke (dump/copy/update/iter/array) | 577 | identical¹ |\n| parse + error messages + file/fd/callback I/O | 1.3k | identical |\n| pack/unpack/sprintf incl. all error paths | 106 | identical |\n| internal ABI (dtoa_r×all modes, dtoa, gethex, strtod\\_\\_unused, utf8_*, strbuffer_*, hashtable_*, jsonp_*) | 12,181 | identical |\n| `dtoa_divmax` sweep × 33k random doubles | 33,003 | identical |\n| 60-vararg pack/unpack/sprintf (register spill) | 7 | identical |\n| fuzz: 4k random JSON round-trips, 60k random-bitpattern doubles, 40k decimal strings, 160k gethex | 486,612 | identical |\n| fuzz: 300k malformed-input parses, rehash stress, 200KB strings | 736,260 | identical |\n| dtoa allocating path / `nrv_alloc` short-buffer edge cases | 20,450 | identical |\n\n¹ sole difference is a heap address printed by the test itself."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":418407,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":352,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edad202f-0f9f-4ede-ae82-1336f987f2e0","uuid":"b3085d43-d64c-4136-b4b5-98792674a553","timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:38:22.426Z"}
